App 5. STAG Graph Viewer. Depends on App 17. Interactive viewer for a complete STAG.

App 6. Partition Sensitivity Explorer. Depends on App 17. Re-derives labels under an alternative partition.

App 7. Revision History Viewer. Depends on App 17. Timeline view of a STAG's revision chain.

App 8. Pipeline Specification Wizard. Depends on App 12. Produces a machine-readable pipeline specification.

App 9. Full-Pipeline Simulator. Depends on App 18, App 11, and App 12. The core engine of the Null-Model Protocol.

App 19. Reproducibility Deposit Template. Depends on App 17 and App 18. Template for a reproducible deposit.

App 20. Provenance-Aware Annotation Database. Depends on App 17 and App 3. Stores annotations with their provenance.

App 21. STAG Audit Tool. Depends on App 17. Runs the checklist audit against a submitted document.

App 11. Effective-Null Builder. No dependencies, but it is needed by App 9. Build this in Stage 1 or Stage 2.

